  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that for RNA-only models, multiprofile with avgpool aggregation (config_002, 0.59 accuracy) outperforms singleprofile. This experiment tests replacing pca_n2000 with scvi_n200 RNA encoder in the same multiprofile/avgpool setup to isolate the impact of RNA encoder choice. It directly addresses uncertainty about whether scvi_n200 (a more complex encoder) improves performance compared to pca_n2000, while maintaining other parameters consistent with the currently strongest RNA-only configuration."
}

